Component	Purpose
ReentrantLock	Ensures only one thread modifies the queue at a time.
notFull (Condition)	Producers wait here when the queue is full and are signaled after a consumer removes an element.
notEmpty (Condition)	Consumers wait here when the queue is empty and are signaled after a producer inserts an element.
await()	Releases the lock and suspends the thread until it is signaled.
signal()	Wakes one waiting thread on the associated condition.